    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d638">

                <pb facs="0761" n="751" xml:id="pg751"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.6359/10–248: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Stuart</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1948-10-02T12:00:00-05:00">October 2, 1948—noon.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1390. Ref last para urtel 1818, Oct 2, you are authorized to conclude
                    understanding on basis Deptel 859, June 9, which is finalized position of Dept
                    with reference para 3, Deptel 783.<anchor n="22" xml:id="d638-f1"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lovett</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
